+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that HTTPS is used everywhere, with no exceptions, so plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts: internal hosts are held to the same HTTPS requirement as every other host. This is consistent with the recorded decision to verify certificates on all builds.
